.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Horner&#x27;s 1819 scheme rewrites a_n x^n + \dots + a_0 as nested multiplications, using n multiplications instead of the 2n - 1 of the term-by-term form. Its intermediate values are the coefficients of the quotient p(x) / (x - x_0), which gives the derivative for Newton&#x27;s method and lets a found root be divided out (&quot;deflation&quot;). This script finds all roots of a quartic that way and compares operation counts.">

